# Frontend Architecture Rules

## React + TypeScript
- Mobile-first UX
- Telegram Mini Apps SDK (@twa-dev/sdk)
- Vite build system

## User Flow Components
1. Auth (Telegram initData)
2. Track selection (Supplements/Workouts)
3. Form (short, track-specific)
4. Demo answer display
5. Paywall CTA
6. Payment (Telegram payments)
7. Full answer + PDF download
8. History view
9. Trainer referral

## State Management
- React hooks for local state
- API calls via fetch/axios
- Telegram SDK for payments and initData

## Styling
- Mobile-first responsive design
- Telegram WebApp theme colors
- Fast loading, minimal dependencies